      "Refer to a clinical psychologist for Cognitive Behaviour Therapy and other non-pharmacological treatment modalities. Refer to a psychiatrist in severe cases not responsive to drug treatment. PANIC DISORDERS Refer children with symptoms suggestive of a panic disorder to a paediatrician. Also refer patients to a psychologist for Cognitive Behaviour Therapy and to a psychiatrist for additional drug therapy where indicated. - Substance Use Disorders"
