      "Individuals with severe and morbid obesity may require referral to a physician specialist and occasionally may need psychological counselling. Individuals who gain weight rapidly over a short period may have an underlying hormonal disorder and will require referral to a physician or endocrinologist. Chapter Obstetric Care and Obstetric Disorders"
