      "Maximum dose is 2 mg/kg (for both plain and with adrenaline added) Note 30-1 Bupivacaine should be used with caution. Apart from general resuscitative mea- sures, intralipid 20% is effective for the treatment of cardiotoxicity. C. Ropivacaine",
